  "result": "```json\n{\n    \"smpl.ordering.controllers.PingController\": {\n        \"summary\": \"Spring MVC controller that provides health check and status endpoints for the ordering service. Exposes two endpoints at '/ping': (1) HEAD method - performs a simple health check returning HTTP 200 OK for lightweight service availability verification, and (2) GET method - returns detailed status information including ping/validation messages from OrderingServiceProperties, build number, and build timestamp loaded from 'buildinfo.properties'. Key features include: lazy loading and caching of build properties in a private Properties field; exception handling integrated with Application Insights TelemetryClient for monitoring failures; returns HTTP 500 with exception details on errors. Dependencies: OrderingServiceProperties (autowired for configuration messages), PropertyHelper (for loading build properties), and Utility (for telemetry client access). Implements a standard ping/health check pattern commonly used in microservices for monitoring, diagnostics, and automated health checks.\",\n        \"file_path\": \"smpl/ordering/controllers/PingController.java\"\n    }\n}\n```",
